        <p style="text-indent: 1em" rend="first-line-indent(1)" source="#source-17750-18077"><seg source="#source-17750-17796">（８）Kellner! Kaffee!―― Nu bin ich </seg><seg source="#source-17799-17802">blo</seg><hi rend="accent" snh:accent-code="1-09-53" snh:source-marker="s&amp;" source="#source-17802-17804" corresp="#source-17796-17799 #source-17804-17807">ß</hi><seg source="#source-17807-17845"> neugierig, wie lange das dauert, bis </seg><hi rend="bold" source="#source-17845-17881" corresp="#source-17851-17881"><seg source="#source-17845-17851">keiner</seg></hi><seg source="#source-17881-17888"> kommt.</seg><note type="variant" subtype="unresolved" source="#source-17888-17942">［＃「neugierig」は底本では「ngugierig」］</note><seg source="#source-17942-17944"> [</seg><hi rend="italic" source="#source-17944-18074" corresp="#source-17944-17959 #source-18050-18074"><seg source="#source-17962-17995">Jul. Keller und Louis Herrmann: K</seg><hi rend="accent" snh:accent-code="1-09-76" snh:source-marker="o:" source="#source-17995-17997" corresp="#source-17959-17962 #source-18047-18050">ö</hi><seg source="#source-17997-18009">nig Krause, </seg><g ref="#gaiji-1-13-24" source="#source-18009-18047">Ⅳ</g></hi><seg source="#source-18074-18077">]</seg></p>
